B.aF2=new A.AV('2. Rule #2: Rule out the "Impersonators". For every L5 radikulopathy, verify the Fibular (Peroneal) nerve. For every C6, check the Median nerve. Prove it\'s the root by finding abnormalities "upstream" of where the plexus begins.',null)
