B.HF=new A.f3("Rhythm","Distinguish between a semi-rhythmic 'rain on a tin roof' vs. perfectly regular 'machine-like' firing.")
B.HD=new A.f3("Recruitment","Observe how units activate with increasing force. Does the rate go up, or do more units jump in?")
