B.agc=new A.aY("A motor unit potential has 6 phases and increased duration. What process does this most likely represent?",B.a43,2,"Polyphasic, long-duration, high-amplitude MUAPs are the hallmark of chronic neurogenic reinnervation. Surviving neurons send collateral sprouts to adopt orphaned muscle fibers.")
