B.agm=new A.aY("An 'Erb's Palsy' typically involves which roots and results in what classic limb posture?",B.a3a,1,"Erb's palsy involves the Upper Trunk (C5-C6). Loss of abductors and external rotators results in the arm being adducted and internally rotated (Waiter's Tip).")
