B.agk=new A.aY("During reinnervation after a severe global plexus injury, which of these muscles will show recovery FIRST?",B.a1Y,2,"Nerves regrow at ~1mm/day. Muscles closest to the plexus (proximal, like the Biceps) will receive axons and show recovery long before distal hand muscles.")
