B.agw=new A.aY("A patient has numbness in the small finger and weakness of finger abduction. The dorsal ulnar hand is also numb. Where is the lesion?",B.a3L,1,"The dorsal ulnar cutaneous nerve branches PROXIMAL to Guyon's canal. If dorsal ulnar hand sensation is abnormal, the lesion must be at or above the elbow (cubital tunnel). Guyon's canal lesions spare dorsal sensation because that branch has already departed.")
